{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"zhonghua-p2-huaji","name":"华缉（华歆弟）","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-49c05c7f9300a7f1ca94"],"facts":[{"id":"zhonghua-f2-189824acb2f084809d8b","text":"华缉为华歆弟，文帝分华歆户邑封为列侯。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-49c05c7f9300a7f1ca94"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhonghua-q2-49c05c7f9300a7f1ca94","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-b9ff3cff7db23cc492dd","layer":"original","quote":"太和五年，歆薨。谥曰敬侯。﹝一﹞子表嗣。初，文帝分歆户邑，封歆弟缉列侯。表，咸熙中为尚书。﹝二﹞","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":206,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
